   262	        // accessor returns the FIRST. Rather than reimplement a JSON parser to recover the first, this
   263	        // REFUSES a body with duplicate top-level keys — the value Telegram would use cannot be
   264	        // determined here, and an undecidable request is a closed door (pass 38 finding 1).
