   460	  }
   461	
   462	  // F2 (pass 40): the door read `init.body`, checked THAT value, and then handed the caller's original
   463	  // mutable object to `fetch`. A getter, or any mutation between the read and the send, could show
   464	  // visible content to the check and different content to the network — which falsifies the claim this
   465	  // file makes about checking the exact bytes that go on the wire.
